        "content": "## Audio + FFmpeg test (no loops)\nCloudflare voice → save WAV → FFmpeg to MP3 → read MP3 back → check.\n\n1. Fill **Test Config**\n2. Start n8n from a terminal with:\n`set NODES_EXCLUDE=[]`\n`set N8N_RESTRICT_FILE_ACCESS_TO=C:/Temp`\n`npx n8n`\n3. Click **Execute workflow**\n4. The last node shows `is_mp3: true` when it worked",
